OL,3,ABoard of Peace's Gaza envoy criticises
OL,4,AIsraeli strikes and Hamas actions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior official on US President
OL,7,FDonald Trump's Board of Peace has
OL,8,Fcriticised Israel's continuing air
OL,9,Fstrikes on Gaza, as well as the actions
OL,10,Fof the Palestinian armed group Hamas.
OL,12,FNickolay Mladenov warned that a
OL,13,Fcollapse of last October's ceasefire
OL,14,Fwould be "a point of no return" for the
OL,15,Fregion.
OL,17,FHe was speaking to the UN Security
OL,18,FCouncil after Israel rejected the
OL,19,F15-point roadmap for Hamas's
OL,20,Fdisarmament, which was announced by the
OL,21,FBoard of Peace last month.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
