OL,3,ABoard of Peace's Gaza envoy criticises
OL,4,AIsraeli strikes and Hamas actions
OL,5,
OL,6,FHamas has agreed to give up its weapons
OL,7,Fin exchange for a phased Israeli troop
OL,8,Fwithdrawal. But Israel has insisted
OL,9,Fthat the group must fully disarm before
OL,10,Fany pullout.
